                        "sense_id": "6d042754-70d1-36d8-8dd3-eadcd22ba8b9",
                        "entry_id": "efc1a62f-cb2c-3311-b201-84188e854826",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of, exhibiting, or affected with megalomania."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6458e39a-6d6d-4d1c-9fcd-ce4d09d75ada",
                                "sense_id": "6d042754-70d1-36d8-8dd3-eadcd22ba8b9",
                                "text": "Often, for good measure, Hitler is given as an example of a megalomaniac person. So, for our convenience, Hitler personifies the illness called megalomania[…]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4e414441-a5d7-49fb-89eb-f03ead271792",
                        "source_entry_id": "efc1a62f-cb2c-3311-b201-84188e854826",
                        "source_sense_id": "6d042754-70d1-36d8-8dd3-eadcd22ba8b9",
                        "source_sense_description": "of, exhibiting, or affected with megalomania",
                        "target_lang_word": "megalomanský",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "megalomanský",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17417cde-06f0-3d45-9fa2-da117647328b",
                                        "entry_id": "16722cae-2dba-3c3a-b5c9-ae1392e743fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "související s megalomanií"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f3d73667-2fd4-4d16-ad9d-7bcb81cb9e09",
                                                "sense_id": "17417cde-06f0-3d45-9fa2-da117647328b",
                                                "text": "„Toto je pro Brno typické. Plánují se tu jen megalomanské projekty,“ zlobí se Bohuslav Šamánek, předseda oddílu Kanoe Klub Spoj Brno s více než sedmdesátiletou tradicí, v narážce na sedmimiliardovou investici do hokejové arény vznikající na výstavišti."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "965e91f5-bf33-45f2-a60f-ea8475fe07f7",
                        "source_entry_id": "efc1a62f-cb2c-3311-b201-84188e854826",
                        "source_sense_id": "6d042754-70d1-36d8-8dd3-eadcd22ba8b9",
                        "source_sense_description": "of, exhibiting, or affected with megalomania",
                        "target_lang_word": "mégalomane",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mégalomane",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c18b885f-cad8-346f-bc52-974a878c4fc1",
                                        "entry_id": "6533ee6f-8d02-3d0b-849e-a6a50c2cecbe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est atteint de mégalomanie."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ee5b4872-71d3-47cb-9618-16c0c728bedc",
                                                "sense_id": "c18b885f-cad8-346f-bc52-974a878c4fc1",
                                                "text": "Processus évidents sous les règnes de Louis XV et Louis XVI, dont les gouvernements ne poursuivaient pas la politique de contrôle social, d’imposition et de guerre totale de Louis XIV, notre Roi-Soleil mégalomane."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dec7f510-384a-4d5c-bc9c-5f0e4e643053",
                                                "sense_id": "c18b885f-cad8-346f-bc52-974a878c4fc1",
                                                "text": "Piot est bien supérieur à Courtois. Non seulement il n'a pas commis toutes les boulettes dont Courtois à fait sa spécialité (contre Liverpool, Barcelone ou la Russie et j'en oublie) mais en plus Piot n'a jamais eu une grande gueule de mégalomane."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mégalomane",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a23a997b-bb08-3069-b957-d66778a37665",
                                        "entry_id": "346a0679-71ff-3f6b-85c1-fa127550f1e6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne atteinte de la folie des grandeurs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d90e7f2b-0f4a-444e-a90c-3477084b5a70",
                                                "sense_id": "a23a997b-bb08-3069-b957-d66778a37665",
                                                "text": "Un mégalomane."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d3ec129-7810-41f3-a55e-e8204d1f07dc",
                                                "sense_id": "a23a997b-bb08-3069-b957-d66778a37665",
                                                "text": "Le mégalomane manifeste des idées de grandeur, un orgueil excessif."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
